<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Admin Control Center - The Modern Pedagogues</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  <style>
    :root{--admin-ink:#0f172a;--admin-muted:#64748b;--admin-line:#e2e8f0;--admin-blue:#2563eb;--admin-purple:#7c3aed}
    .admin-shell{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px 70px}
    .admin-hero{border-radius:28px;padding:32px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%,rgba(124,58,237,.35),transparent 35%),linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e3a8a);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(15,23,42,.22);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .admin-hero:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;right:-90px;bottom:-150px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
    .eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.7;font-weight:800}
    .admin-hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,48px);margin:8px 0;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.04em}
    .admin-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:18px}
    .admin-stat{padding:20px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,.07);border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.06)}
    .admin-stat .value{font-size:32px;font-weight:900;color:var(--admin-ink);margin-top:7px}.admin-stat .label{font-size:12px;color:var(--admin-muted);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
    .admin-section{margin-top:22px;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--admin-line);border-radius:22px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.86);box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(15,23,42,.06)}
    .admin-section h2{margin:0 0 5px}.section-copy{color:var(--admin-muted);margin:0 0 16px}
    .quick-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:11px}.quick{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none!important;padding:15px;border:1px solid var(--admin-line);border-radius:16px;background:#fff;color:var(--admin-ink);transition:.18s}.quick:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(15,23,42,.08);border-color:#bfdbfe}.quick-icon{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#eff6ff;font-size:19px}.quick strong{display:block;font-size:14px}.quick small{color:var(--admin-muted)}
    .ai-guide{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:stretch}.ai-guide-card{padding:18px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#eef2ff);border:1px solid #dbeafe}.ai-guide-card h3{margin:0 0 7px}.ai-guide-card p{margin:0;color:var(--admin-muted);line-height:1.55}.ai-key{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbeafe;font:600 12px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;color:#1e3a8a}
    .analytics-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.analytics-card{padding:17px;border-radius:17px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--admin-line)}
    .bar-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(14,1fr);align-items:end;gap:5px;height:130px;margin-top:15px}.bar{min-height:3px;border-radius:7px 7px 2px 2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--admin-blue),#93c5fd)}
    @media(max-width:900px){.admin-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.analytics-grid,.ai-guide{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    @media(max-width:560px){.admin-shell{padding:16px 12px 50px}.admin-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.admin-hero{padding:24px 20px;border-radius:22px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>
  <main class="admin-shell">
    <section class="admin-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Modern Pedagogues • Operations</div>
      <h1>Admin Control Center</h1>
      <p style="max-width:720px;opacity:.82;margin:0">Manage learners, tutors, learning content, marketplace activity and the LMS from one clean workspace.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px;position:relative;z-index:2">
        <a href="/admin/lms" class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:#172554">Open LMS Control Center</a>
        <a href="/admin/marketplace" class="btn ghost" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);color:#fff">Marketplace Moderation</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-grid">
      <div class="admin-stat"><div class="label">Users</div><div class="value"><%= stats.users %></div><span class="muted">All platform accounts</span></div>
      <div class="admin-stat"><div class="label">Products</div><div class="value"><%= stats.products %></div><span class="muted">Store resources</span></div>
      <div class="admin-stat"><div class="label">Orders</div><div class="value"><%= stats.orders %></div><span class="muted">Commerce activity</span></div>
      <div class="admin-stat"><div class="label">Messages</div><div class="value"><%= stats.messages %></div><span class="muted">Parent/client enquiries</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-section">
      <h2>Meet Kaitlyn</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">Kaitlyn is now the platform's AI learning and client-support assistant. Give her verified company information through the existing Content Editor and she will use it as authoritative context in conversations.</p>
      <div class="ai-guide">
        <div class="ai-guide-card">
          <h3>Feed Kaitlyn company knowledge</h3>
          <p>Create or update site-content entries using the <strong>ai_company_</strong> prefix. Keep each entry factual and specific — for example company overview, services, policies, pricing, contacts, locations, tutor information and programme details.</p>
          <span class="ai-key">ai_company_about</span>
          <span class="ai-key">ai_company_services</span>
          <span class="ai-key">ai_company_policies</span>
          <span class="ai-key">ai_company_contacts</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-guide-card">
          <h3>How Kaitlyn uses it</h3>
          <p>Company entries are loaded directly from the database for each AI request. Kaitlyn prioritises administrator-provided facts, answers naturally rather than copying a knowledge-base article, and avoids inventing missing company details.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="/admin/content">Open AI Knowledge Editor</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-section">
      <h2>Learning operations</h2><p class="section-copy">The tools you will use most to run the tutoring programme.</p>
      <div class="quick-grid">
        <a class="quick" href="/admin/lms"><span class="quick-icon">🎓</span><span><strong>LMS Control Center</strong><small>Wards, tutors, assignments & results</small></span></a>
        <a class="quick" href="/enroll-ward"><span class="quick-icon">👨‍👩‍👧</span><span><strong>Enrollment Portal</strong><small>Parent ward enrollment</small></span></a>
        <a class="quick" href="/tutor-lms"><span class="quick-icon">🧑‍🏫</span><span><strong>Tutor Workspace</strong><small>Assignments & marking</small></span></a>
        <a class="quick" href="/admin/users"><span class="quick-icon">👥</span><span><strong>User Management</strong><small>Create tutor accounts</small></span></a>
        <a class="quick" href="/admin/media"><span class="quick-icon">🖼️</span><span><strong>Media Manager</strong><small>Hero banners & tutor profiles</small></span></a>
        <a class="quick" href="/admin/applications"><span class="quick-icon">📄</span><span><strong>Tutor Applications</strong><small>Review applicants</small></span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-section">
      <h2>Platform operations</h2><p class="section-copy">Content, commerce and communication controls.</p>
      <div class="quick-grid">
        <a class="quick" href="/admin/products"><span class="quick-icon">📚</span><span><strong>Manage Products</strong><small>Books and resources</small></span></a>
        <a class="quick" href="/admin/orders"><span class="quick-icon">🧾</span><span><strong>Orders</strong><small>Review transactions</small></span></a>
        <a class="quick" href="/admin/content"><span class="quick-icon">✏️</span><span><strong>Edit Content</strong><small>Site copy and Kaitlyn knowledge</small></span></a>
        <a class="quick" href="/admin/messages"><span class="quick-icon">💬</span><span><strong>Messages</strong><small>Client enquiries</small></span></a>
        <a class="quick" href="/admin/seller-applications"><span class="quick-icon">🛡️</span><span><strong>Seller Reviews</strong><small>Marketplace approvals</small></span></a>
        <a class="quick" href="/admin/export/orders"><span class="quick-icon">⬇️</span><span><strong>Exports</strong><small>Download operational data</small></span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-section">
      <h2>Activity — last 14 days</h2><p class="section-copy">A lightweight operational pulse without overwhelming the dashboard.</p>
      <div id="charts" class="analytics-grid"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-section">
      <h2>AI Tutor analytics</h2>
      <div class="analytics-grid" style="margin-top:14px">
        <div class="analytics-card"><strong>Total chats</strong><div style="font-size:26px;font-weight:900;margin-top:5px"><%= aiAnalytics.totalChats || 0 %></div></div>
        <div class="analytics-card"><strong>Fallback rate</strong><div style="font-size:26px;font-weight:900;margin-top:5px"><%= aiAnalytics.fallbackRate || 0 %>%</div></div>
        <div class="analytics-card"><strong>Low confidence</strong><div style="font-size:26px;font-weight:900;margin-top:5px"><%= aiAnalytics.lowConfidenceRate || 0 %>%</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
  <script>
    fetch('/admin/metrics').then(r=>r.json()).then(data=>{
      const charts=document.getElementById('charts');
      [['Orders',data.orders||[]],['Messages',data.messages||[]],['Applications',data.applications||[]]].forEach(([label,series])=>{
        const box=document.createElement('div');box.className='analytics-card';
        const max=Math.max(1,...series);box.innerHTML='<strong>'+label+'</strong>';
        const bars=document.createElement('div');bars.className='bar-grid';
        series.forEach(v=>{const b=document.createElement('div');b.className='bar';b.style.height=Math.max(3,Math.round((Number(v)/max)*110))+'px';b.title=v;bars.appendChild(b)});
        box.appendChild(bars);charts.appendChild(box)
      })
    }).catch(()=>{})
  </script>
</body>
</html>
